<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Genre:</strong> Action</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>A keter class humanoid that can produce weapons at their free will.</li>
<li>Very hostile to all foundation members</li>
<li>Cannot be killed</li>
<li>Caused many Containment Breaches</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong><br />
The tales of the SCP vainly trying to free all other imprisoned SCPs at the site.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong></p>
<p>It is different because it is satient and opposes the foundation purely on ethical issues.<br />
Hates the testing and the brutal killings done to D-Class personnel<br />
Only goal is to wipe out the foundation and free all of the SCPs</p>

